# Build context for rust.Dockerfile: the Cargo workspace and nothing else.
*

!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
# The broker's manifest (built into the binary), the committed OpenAPI document (a test reads
# it), the example file (a test reads it) and the vendored pacod-id crates.
!authz
!docs/openapi.json
!deploy/.env.example
!vendor/pacod-id
!deploy/docker/healthcheck.rs

**/target
**/proptest-regressions
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
!deploy/.env.example
